{"4668740":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Lustflame Bonsai","steam_appid":4668740,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4668740\/extras\/72ae80b7d3813c5194101edac979c631.avif?t=1790595808\" width=800 height=300 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Ruined Sect, a Single Spiritual Field<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You inherit no glorious immortal sect—only a stretch of wasteland. Clear the land, sow seeds, harvest crops, refine pills, and take on commissions.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day: Tend your herb garden, gather resources, and rebuild the sect<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the gate: Explore mystic realms, face random events, and fight turn-based battles<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relationships: Follow exclusive story routes with five heroines<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4668740\/extras\/78ae3ef6d837706d12992bf8b649ca53.avif?t=1790595808\" width=800 height=300 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌱 <strong>Farm and rebuild: <\/strong>Cultivate spiritual fields, grow spirit herbs, and harvest your crops.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Turn-based combat: <\/strong>Combine party members, equipment, and skills to face ever stronger foes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💗 <strong>Build relationships: <\/strong>Grow closer to each character and advance her personal story.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 <strong>Commissions and trade: <\/strong>Complete noticeboard tasks to earn resources and equipment.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ <strong>Mystic realm exploration: <\/strong>Venture into the ancient Blight-Rift Mine and other areas, where random events await.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 <strong>Boss battles: <\/strong>Challenge the Demo’s final boss and complete the opening adventure.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4668740\/extras\/a90d97e0646f9323e8d295544ff95470.avif?t=1790595808\" width=800 height=300 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Five Companions<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Li Wanxing<\/strong>　<br>The Demon Sect’s saintess is proud and possessive. What frightens her most is that you might see only the “saintess,” and never Li Wanxing herself.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4668740\/extras\/2ac499dfbd8bd9fe1ecc1cbd5e052798.poster.avif?t=1790595808\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4668740\/extras\/2ac499dfbd8bd9fe1ecc1cbd5e052798.webm?t=1790595808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4668740\/extras\/2ac499dfbd8bd9fe1ecc1cbd5e052798.mp4?t=1790595808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Su Qinghan<\/strong><br>Once your senior sister in the same sect, she is cool-faced, quiet, and steady.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4668740\/extras\/59287353db293b2a3e17a5e547d18ea9.poster.avif?t=1790595808\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4668740\/extras\/59287353db293b2a3e17a5e547d18ea9.webm?t=1790595808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4668740\/extras\/59287353db293b2a3e17a5e547d18ea9.mp4?t=1790595808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hua Liuli<\/strong><br>Sweet-talking and adorable, she knows her own mind. Save her if you can, but never choose for her.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4668740\/extras\/8cba69b5421872851b3a1360c1eb642d.poster.avif?t=1790595808\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4668740\/extras\/8cba69b5421872851b3a1360c1eb642d.webm?t=1790595808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4668740\/extras\/8cba69b5421872851b3a1360c1eb642d.mp4?t=1790595808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shuangling<\/strong><br>Her wrist bell holds time-sand that can flow backward. Within the rift are countless versions of her: rescued, missed, or never met at all. She wants you to call the woman standing before you Shuangling—not an echo of some other past.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4668740\/extras\/ccc6cd01bc12fbba66590a97bffd7aa9.poster.avif?t=1790595808\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4668740\/extras\/ccc6cd01bc12fbba66590a97bffd7aa9.webm?t=1790595808\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4668740\/extras\/ccc6cd01bc12fbba66590a97bffd7aa9.mp4?t=1790595808\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who sets you